    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Also, the inﬁmum in the left-hand side of (4) and the supremum in the right-hand side of (4) are both attainable, and the value of the supremum in the right-hand side does not change if one restricts (ϕ,ψ) to be bounded and continuous."
