    "font" : "CMTI10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Remark 1 Note that the cost function c(y0,y1) may be inﬁnite for some (y0,y1) ∈ R2. Since c is a nonnegative function, the integral c(y0,y1)dπ ∈ [0,∞] is well-deﬁned."
  }, {
